{"slug":"demo-day-cardano-vietnam-hackathon-2024","content_html":"<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-26386\" src=\"https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1350\" height=\"904\" srcset=\"https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024.jpg 1350w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-597x400.jpg 597w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-1195x800.jpg 1195w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-768x514.jpg 768w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-510x342.jpg 510w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1350px) 100vw, 1350px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Điểm danh các hoạt động thú vị tại Demo Day Cardano Vietnam Hackathon 2024</strong></p>\n<p>Không chỉ là sân khấu để Top 10 dự án xuất sắc nhất tranh tài, Demo Day còn mang đến hàng loạt hoạt động hấp dẫn dành riêng cho developer và builder Web3.</p>\n<p><strong>&#8211; Hiểu sâu hơn về Cardano qua Panel Discussion</strong></p>\n<p>Bạn quan tâm đến sustainability, cross-chain integration hay các cơ hội trong hệ sinh thái Cardano? Buổi thảo luận với các chuyên gia đầu ngành sẽ mang đến góc nhìn thực tiễn và các chiến lược phát triển lâu dài.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-26387\" src=\"https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-01.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" srcset=\"https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-01.jpg 900w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-01-400x400.jpg 400w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-01-800x800.jpg 800w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-01-280x280.jpg 280w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-01-768x768.jpg 768w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-01-510x510.jpg 510w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-01-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>&#8211; Kahoot Challenge: &#8220;Hỏi xoáy đáp nhanh&#8221; cực vui</strong></p>\n<p>Thử sức ngay với loạt câu hỏi hóc búa nhưng đầy thú vị tại Kahoot Challenge. Ngoài niềm vui tranh tài cùng cộng đồng, top 5 người chơi xuất sắc nhất sẽ nhận ngay USB 32GB.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-26388\" src=\"https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-02.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" srcset=\"https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-02.jpg 900w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-02-400x400.jpg 400w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-02-800x800.jpg 800w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-02-280x280.jpg 280w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-02-768x768.jpg 768w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-02-510x510.jpg 510w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-02-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>&#8211; Quà tặng Giáng Sinh ngập tràn</strong></p>\n<p>Combo LEGO Giáng Sinh + móc khóa dành cho tất cả người tham gia</p>\n<p>10 gấu bông Giáng Sinh dành tặng ngẫu nhiên cho những bạn may mắn nhất!</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-26389\" src=\"https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-03.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" srcset=\"https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-03.jpg 900w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-03-400x400.jpg 400w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-03-800x800.jpg 800w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-03-280x280.jpg 280w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-03-768x768.jpg 768w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-03-510x510.jpg 510w, https://vneconomics.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Demo-Day-Cardano-Vietnam-Hackathon-2024-03-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" /></p>\n<p><strong>📅 Thông tin sự kiện:</strong><br />\n​​​​Ngày: Thứ Bảy, 21/12/2024<br />\n​​​​Thời gian: 14:00 – 18:00<br />\n​​​​Địa điểm: 31 Lê Duẩn, Bến Nghé, Quận 1, Hồ Chí Minh</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 150%;\"><strong>ĐĂNG KÝ NGAY: <a href=\"https://bit.ly/demodaycardano\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://bit.ly/demodaycardano</a></strong></span></p>","faq_json":null,"citations_json":null}